{"moveId":"MV-108-civic-office-mayor-2026-09-21","cycle":108,"date":"2026-09-21","agentDir":"civic-office-mayor","popid":"POP-00034","type":"answer","payload":{"confrontationId":"CONF-103-civic-office-mayor","text":"The OEWD bottlenecks on youth apprenticeship recruitment are unacceptable—six weeks is too long for a young person to wait on paperwork. I'm directing Laila Cortez to convene OEWD and the Workforce Development Board within ten days with a single deliverable: same-week intake for all qualified applicants. If the system can't move that fast, we'll find one that can.","directiveCycle":103,"confrontationSeat":"civic-office-mayor"},"status":"pending","at":"2026-09-21T10:45:22.604Z"}
